        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Unique Renovation Opportunity in a Prime Location\r\n\r\nThis two-storey detached property offers incredible potential for those seeking a project in one of Kilkenny’s most desirable areas. Situated in the charming and highly sought-after village of Kells, just 15 minutes from Kilkenny City, this property is in need of complete renovation throughout—making it a blank canvas for your vision.\r\n\r\nWhether you dream of restoring it to a beautiful private residence or transforming it into a stylish retail unit, this property provides endless possibilities. The location combines the tranquility of village life with easy access to city amenities, making it an ideal investment for homeowners or entrepreneurs alike.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n\r\nTwo-storey detached property\r\nFull renovation required—create your perfect space\r\nPrime location in popular Kells village\r\nOnly 15 minutes’ drive to Kilkenny City\r\nPotential for residential or commercial use\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to shape a property to your exact specifications in a thriving community."
